{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Persistence is Key"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "At The Job Fair"}, {"type": "position", "content": 1}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 10}, {"type": "level", "content": "B2.1"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Identify and describe issues relating to money, in written and spoken situations according to work and social contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": " Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts.  Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn9le10ob01re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Talking About Hopes And Expectations For The Future"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " Apart from using the Future tense to talk about the future, there are other verbs and patterns you can use to express hope and expectations for the future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "a. Hope + to + verb<br/> \u201cHope\u201d suggests that you want or expect something to be true in the future. <ul><span class=\"italic\"><li>I was hoping to learn a few more tricks. </li> <li>I hope to get an interview soon. </li> </span> </ul>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "b. (be) + plan (-ing) + to + verb / (be) + plan (-ing) + on + -ing  <br/> \u201cplan\u201d indicates that you think carefully about actions that you need to take in order to achieve something. <ul><span class=\"italic\"><li> I'm planning on going to that one too. </li> <li> That's what I'm planning to do.</li> <li>I'm planning to go for a walk soon. </li> </span> </ul>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "c. be going to + verb<br/> Use this structure to express the idea that you intend to do something in the future. <ul><span class=\"italic\"><li>I'm going to check that booth out. </li> <li>I'm going to look for a job here. </li> </span> </ul>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "d. would like + to + verb <br/> This structure can also be used to express the idea that you plan on doing something in the future. <ul><span class=\"italic\"><li>I'd like to do of those while I'm here. </li> <li>I'd like to start looking for a job while I'm here. </li> </span> </ul>"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Reported Speech"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You use reported speech when you are saying (reporting)  what other people said. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you tell people what someone has said in the past, you generally make the verb tense 'more in the past'. You need to change the verb to the next past form. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example:<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Direct speech</span><ul> <li><span class=\"italic\">I came across a multimedia specialist post.</li></span></ul> <span class=\"strong\">Reported speech</span> <ul><li><span class=\"italic\">She told me she had come across a multimedia specialist post.</li> </span> </ul>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "When changing sentences from direct speech, check if you have to change the following:<ul><li>pronouns (I said \u2192 He said)</li> <li>Present tense verbs </li> <li>Place and time expressions</li> <li>Tenses (backshift \u2192 change to the past)</li> </ul>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Some reporting verbs and expressions commonly used are: <span class=\"strong\">say</span> , <span class=\"strong\">tell</span> , and <span class=\"strong\">according to</span> ."}, {"type": "example", "content": "My friend <span class=\"strong\">told </span> me he went to one and learned a lot of tips and tricks about how to write a resume."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">According to</span>  the man at the booth, the type of work you do varies depending on your employer."}, {"type": "example", "content": "She <span class=\"strong\">said</span>  they were doing on the spot interviews."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "career guidance "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " services that help people successfully manage their career development"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I got here, signed in and then went to a workshop on career guidance."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le10ob01aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to talk about looking for a job."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "art and culture"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an area or section where you turn to when you want to expand your mind and horizons"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I've only been to the art and culture section."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le10ob01aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "copywriter"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a job in which you write the words for advertisements"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There were a few copywriter positions."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le10ob01aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "market researcher"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a job in which you collect information about what products people like to buy or what people like or dislike about a product"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There's a market researcher position."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le10ob01aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to have the credentials for "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to possess qualities, achievements or experiences that make you suitable for something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  I'm not sure I have the credentials for those positions. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le10ob01aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "multimedia specialist"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person whose jobs involves using video, sound and other methods of communication in computers. "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: She told me about a multimedia specialist posting she came across."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le10ob01aud06"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Tell a friend about your career now or a career you want in the future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write out a five year plan for your hopes and expectations the future of your career. (200 words)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read you plan to your friend."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Ask you friend about their five year plan for the future."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I talk about my future career."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write about hopes and expectations for your career."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I read my plan about hopes and dreams aloud."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I ask my friend about his/her future career."}]}], "labs": [{"exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [0], "type": "WLC", "questions": [], "img_path": "", "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can discuss hopes and expectations for the future."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can talk about jobs, professions and careers."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can quote other people"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " Are you career oriented? Do you constantly try to improve your CV? How?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " Have you ever been to a job fair? How did you like it?"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 t