 class= \"strong\"> Adam</span>: It was alright \u2026 boring. My friend told me he went to one and learned a lot of tips and tricks about how to write a resume. I was hoping to learn a few more tricks, butI learned nothing!<br />", "id": 1}, {"time": "33300", "image": "", "text": "<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: I know what you mean. There's another workshop later. I'm planning on going to that one. <br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Adam</span>: I'm done with workshops today, maybe forever. <br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>:  Which booths have you visited? <br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Adam</span>: Meh \u2026 I've only been to the art and culture section. I checked out a few public relations booths. <br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: Cool. Anything interesting? <br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Adam</span>: There were a few copywriter positions and a market researcher position. That sounded interesting, I guess. I'm not sure I have the credentials for those positions. <br />", "id": 2}, {"time": "64500", "image": "", "text": "<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: What does that position involve?<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Adam</span>: You have a lot of questions. According to the man at the booth, the type of work you do varies depending on your employer.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: I was talking to someone at the workshop. She told me about a multimedia specialist posting she came across. She said they were doing on the spot interviews. <br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Adam</span>: On the spot interviews, you say?  I'd like to do one of those while I'm here. I'm going to check that booth out. <br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: Well, good luck with it. <br />", "id": 3}], "video_src": "engenn9le10ob01re2vid01"}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "video", "id": 1, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "picture", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn9le10ob01re6img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn9le10ob01re6aud01", "images": []}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 2, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "picture", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn9le10ob01re6img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn9le10ob01re6aud02", "images": []}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 3, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "p", "value": "<span class=\"strong\">Graham</span>: I've been looking for new opportunities in marketing and advertising. I want to move into an art and culture work environment but I don't want to do market research anymore. Maybe Sam, who is a multimedia specialist for an art gallery, can give me some advice or point me in the right direction.  Even though I don't have the experience or the credentials to know what I will be suited for, Sam does. She said there was a job in copywriting for the gallery if I wanted it, but I am not so sure about that.<br/> <br/> "}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "text", "id": 4, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}]}]}